msgctxt "64"
msgid "(Those two again...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Wow, we sure bought a lot of souvenirs!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Thank you sooo much, Akimoto-kun! This makes me so happy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"But of course, my love! After all, they're all mementos of the first "
"vacation we ever spent together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Hehehe! Maybe we should buy more, then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Great idea! Oh man, I'm so happy...! Okinawa's the best!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Hey, they're actually doing pretty well!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Yeah. Looks like there was no need to worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "So, how about we head back to the hotel and get a little more comfortable?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Oh, um!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "What's wrong, Mizuki-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "I, um, think I forgot something at the beach... Can I run back and get it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"I can handle it by myself, don't worry! I'll meet you back at the hotel, "
"Akimoto-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "Huh? Don't be ridiculous. I'm coming, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"But I need to take all this to the pawn sh⑬ I mean, it's my fault for being "
"such a dummy. I'd feel bad if I dragged you along!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"No way, I'm not leaving your side, not for a single moment! Now let's get "
"back to that beach!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Something was up with Mizuki-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"You're right about that. It sounded like they were heading back to the "
"beach over by <Color:7>Morning Glory<Color:Default>. We should probably go "
"keep an eye on them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Yeah, that's a good idea. I'm kinda worried..."
msgstr ""

